      "sourceTextSha256": "5792bdc2bced17ae64ba48114e244061364a3bb6f4507afe4dbe897bdbbb173e",
      "text": "Travel from the Pacific coast to the Andes and the ancient cities of the Incas. Begin in Lima, exploring its colonial architecture, then fly to Cusco and continue to the Sacred Valley. Here you visit Ollantaytambo, Moray and Maras, with lunch at Mil Centro. Your Machu Picchu visit includes a journey on the Hiram Bingham train, and the final part of the trip takes you to Cusco and back to Lima.",
