        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw5fhykw-amanda",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "The verified Word has detailed day-by-day content but no equivalent concise website lead. Translated the RU summary, retaining its route and activities; phrased the Hiram Bingham journey without a direction because Word specifies the return leg.",
